File: parser.c
Line: 10741
Function: xmlParseLookupInternalSubset
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Within a loop guarded only by (cur < end), the code accesses cur[1] and cur[2] when checking for the "-->" sequence. If cur is at end-1 or end-2, cur[1] or cur[2] reads past the end of the input buffer, causing an out-of-bounds read.

